title: Fiscal Policy
subtitle: Treasury: taxes, loans, cuts, emission and collection.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/bankrun.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'finance_package') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.finance_package (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.3). Opening and closing
// the card are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser
// who opened the card. Options that need a system of a later stage are shown with their reason.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'finance_package');
!}

= Fiscal policy

The Treasury chooses one instrument per decision (11.9). The vote of the Sejm happens in the same decision; the Senate reviews the law in its dated procedure. One active instrument of each kind; a temporary revenue disappears when it expires.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

